# ── 2026-09 hygiene (Task 7-c): runtime databases are state, not source ──
# db/dex.db (~45MB) and db/dex.db.pre-migration (~6.3MB) were untracked from git
# (local files kept). Git history still contains the old blobs — rewriting history
# (git filter-repo) is an owner-level decision to shrink clones.
# (db/*.db already declared under "# local data" — now effective: the !db/dex.db
# negation above was removed. db/*.db.pre-migration added to cover the backup copy.)
db/*.db.pre-migration
